---
const gallery = [
  {
    src: '/media/games/the-legend-of-zelda.webp',
    name: 'The Legend of Zelda',
    width: 266,
    height: 379,
    alt: 'Cover art for The Legend of Zelda',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/mega-man.webp',
    name: 'Mega Man',
    width: 379,
    height: 265,
    alt: 'Cover art for the original Mega Man',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/super-smash-flash-2.webp',
    name: 'Super Smash Flash 2',
    width: 300,
    height: 231,
    alt: 'Super Smash Flash logo',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/dragon-ball-devolution.webp',
    name: 'Dragon Ball Devolution',
    width: 264,
    height: 352,
    alt: 'Cover art for Dragon Ball Devolution',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/pokemon-yellow.webp',
    name: 'Pokémon Yellow',
    width: 546,
    height: 182,
    alt: 'Cover art for Pokémon Red, Blue and Yellow',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/grand-theft-auto-san-andreas.webp',
    name: 'Grand Theft Auto',
    width: 284,
    height: 351,
    alt: 'Cover art for Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/age-of-empires.webp',
    name: 'Age of Empires',
    width: 256,
    height: 310,
    alt: 'Cover art for Age of Empires',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/counter-strike.webp',
    name: 'Counter-Strike 1.6',
    width: 288,
    height: 346,
    alt: 'Cover art for Counter-Strike',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/pes-2014.webp',
    name: 'PES 2014',
    width: 308,
    height: 323,
    alt: 'Cover art for Pro Evolution Soccer 2014',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/resident-evil.webp',
    name: 'Resident Evil',
    width: 257,
    height: 388,
    alt: 'Cover art for the original Resident Evil',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/silent-hill.webp',
    name: 'Silent Hill',
    width: 316,
    height: 316,
    alt: 'Cover art for the original Silent Hill',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/yume-nikki.webp',
    name: 'Yume Nikki',
    width: 258,
    height: 387,
    alt: 'Header art for Yume Nikki',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/lisa-the-painful.webp',
    name: 'LISA: The Painful',
    width: 447,
    height: 223,
    alt: 'Cover art for LISA: The Painful',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/street-fighter-ii.webp',
    name: 'Street Fighter II',
    width: 257,
    height: 388,
    alt: 'Promotional art for Street Fighter II',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/naruto-ultimate-ninja-storm.webp',
    name: 'Naruto: Ultimate Ninja Storm',
    width: 256,
    height: 295,
    alt: 'Cover art for Naruto: Ultimate Ninja Storm',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/soulcalibur.webp',
    name: 'Soulcalibur',
    width: 267,
    height: 372,
    alt: 'Promotional art for Soulcalibur',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/earthbound.webp',
    name: 'EarthBound',
    width: 369,
    height: 270,
    alt: 'Box art for EarthBound',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/mother-3.webp',
    name: 'Mother 3',
    width: 396,
    height: 252,
    alt: 'Packaging art for Mother 3',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/touhou-6.webp',
    name: 'Touhou 6',
    width: 300,
    height: 296,
    alt: 'Cover art for Touhou 6: the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil',
  },
  {
    src: '/media/games/crazy-zombie.webp',
    name: 'Crazy Zombie',
    width: 400,
    height: 400,
    alt: 'Screenshot from Crazy Zombie',
  },
] as const;
---

<div class="games">
  <header class="games__intro">
    <p class="games__kicker">A lifelong pastime</p>
    <p class="games__lede">
      Video games have been part of my life for as long as I can remember. It
      is, in fact, the pastime I have enjoyed the most and the one I discovered
      earliest.
    </p>
    <p class="games__meta">Childhood · Adolescence · Today</p>
  </header>

  <div class="games__prose">
    <p>
      During my childhood I spent my days playing on a PlayStation 2, where I
      discovered many games that were not exactly appropriate for my age.
    </p>

    <figure class="games__figure games__figure--console">
      <img
        src="/media/games/playstation-2.webp"
        alt="Sony PlayStation 2 console"
        width="1100"
        height="682"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>The PlayStation 2 — the console where it all began.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p>
      I also learned to use emulators and, for a while, became a fan of The
      Legend of Zelda and Mega Man. That helped me survive solitude and a
      complete lack of friends throughout primary school. Other games I was
      lucky enough to discover — mainly through the website Macrojuegos — were
      Super Smash Flash 2, Dragon Ball Devolution, Pokémon Yellow, and many
      others whose names I can no longer remember but for which I still hold a
      great deal of affection.
    </p>

    <figure class="games__figure games__figure--flash">
      <div class="games__flash-grid">
        <div class="games__flash-item">
          <img
            src="/media/games/super-smash-flash-2.webp"
            alt="Super Smash Flash logo"
            width="300"
            height="231"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="games__flash-item">
          <img
            src="/media/games/dragon-ball-devolution.webp"
            alt="Cover art for Dragon Ball Devolution"
            width="264"
            height="352"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="games__flash-item">
          <img
            src="/media/games/pokemon-yellow.webp"
            alt="Cover art for Pokémon Red, Blue and Yellow"
            width="546"
            height="182"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        A few of the Flash games that kept me company: Super Smash Flash 2,
        Dragon Ball Devolution and Pokémon Yellow.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p>
      Later, as puberty and adolescence arrived, I started playing PC titles
      such as Grand Theft Auto, Age of Empires, Counter-Strike 1.6, PES 2014,
      and many others. Around the age of 15 or 16 I became interested in horror
      games like Resident Evil, Silent Hill, Yume Nikki, LISA, and many more. I
      also began to enjoy fighting games such as Street Fighter II, Naruto
      Ultimate Ninja Storm, Soul Calibur, and so on.
    </p>

    <p>
      Among the ones I enjoyed the most during this period are, without a
      doubt, EarthBound and Mother 3, among so many others.
    </p>

    <p>
      These days I have found a taste for Touhou 6, and I have gone a long time
      without being able to complete it even on normal mode.
    </p>

    <aside class="games__spotlight" aria-labelledby="games-crazy-zombie-title">
      <div class="games__spotlight-copy">
        <p class="games__kicker">One more for the list</p>
        <h2 class="games__spotlight-title" id="games-crazy-zombie-title">
          Crazy Zombie
        </h2>
        <p>
          I also have to mention Crazy Zombie, another Flash game that kept me
          company during those years. Its chaotic mix of anime characters and
          zombie hordes was simple, addictive, and impossible to resist. I had
          forgotten to mention it, but it deserves its place here just as much
          as the rest.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="games__spotlight-figure">
        <img
          src="/media/games/crazy-zombie.webp"
          alt="Screenshot from Crazy Zombie"
          width="400"
          height="400"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>Crazy Zombie, one of the Flash games I grew up with.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </aside>

    <p>
      But well, that is enough nostalgia for today. I will surely keep playing
      a few things, even if I cannot know for certain what they will be.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="games__gallery" aria-labelledby="games-gallery-title">
    <header class="games__gallery-header">
      <p class="games__kicker">The collection</p>
      <h2 class="games__gallery-title" id="games-gallery-title">Gallery</h2>
      <p class="games__gallery-lede">
        Every game mentioned in this entry, from emulators and Flash afternoons
        to late-night horror sessions.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="games__gallery-grid">
      {
        gallery.map((game) => (
          <li class="games__gallery-item">
            <figure class="games__gallery-card">
              <img
                class="games__gallery-image"
                src={game.src}
                alt={game.alt}
                width={game.width}
                height={game.height}
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
              <figcaption class="games__gallery-caption">
                {game.name}
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <p class="games__gallery-note">
      All cover art, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .games {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vh, 4rem);
  }

  .games__intro {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .games__kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-title);
  }

  .games__lede {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .games__meta {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 226, 234, 0.58);
  }

  .games__prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(1.1rem, 2.2vh, 1.6rem);
  }

  .games__prose > p {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.1vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 233, 238, 0.92);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .games__figure {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin: clamp(0.6rem, 1.5vh, 1rem) auto;
    padding: clamp(0.75rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    background: linear-gradient(
      160deg,
      rgba(58, 4, 18, 0.5),
      rgba(20, 2, 8, 0.42)
    );
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.26);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 226, 234, 0.05),
      0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  .games__figure > img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 24rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35));
  }

  .games__figure figcaption,
  .games__spotlight-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: center;
    color: rgba(255, 226, 234, 0.68);
  }

  .games__flash-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.5rem, 1.5vw, 1rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .games__flash-item {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 7rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background-color: rgba(20, 2, 8, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.16);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
  }

  .games__flash-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 7.5rem;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35));
  }

  .games__spotlight {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin: clamp(1rem, 3vh, 2rem) auto;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(120, 6, 30, 0.38),
      rgba(20, 2, 8, 0.45)
    );
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.32);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  .games__spotlight-copy p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.05vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 233, 238, 0.9);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .games__spotlight-title {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-title);
    text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 90, 120, 0.3);
  }

  .games__spotlight-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .games__spotlight-figure img {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.22);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .games__gallery {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vh, 1.6rem);
    padding-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 2.5rem);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.2);
  }

  .games__gallery-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .games__gallery-title {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-title);
    text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 90, 120, 0.3);
  }

  .games__gallery-lede {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.05vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 233, 238, 0.82);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .games__gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.6vw, 1rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .games__gallery-item {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .games__gallery-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.55rem;
    background-color: rgba(20, 2, 8, 0.36);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 125, 150, 0.24);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    transition:
      transform 0.18s ease,
      border-color 0.18s ease,
      box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }

  .games__gallery-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    padding: 0.35rem;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
  }

  .games__gallery-caption {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.85vw, 0.82rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: center;
    color: rgba(255, 233, 238, 0.82);
    transition: color 0.18s ease;
  }

  .games__gallery-note {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0.25rem auto 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(255, 226, 234, 0.55);
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .games__gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .games__gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .games__spotlight {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 36rem) {
    .games__flash-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .games__gallery-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: rgba(255, 150, 170, 0.6);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .games__gallery-card:hover .games__gallery-caption {
      color: #ffffff;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .games__gallery-card,
    .games__gallery-caption {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
